cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this educational experiment, cite the repository."
title: "Linear Becomes Experts: A Reproducible Linear-to-MoE Experiment"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "JoeIndyGit"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JoeIndyGit/14-Linear-to-MoE"
abstract: >-
  A NumPy affine digit classifier is trained and upcycled into four independent
  experts with top-2 routing. Fifteen paired cases across five initialization
  seeds and three stratified splits verify continued loss reduction, with
  equal-step and projection-budget linear controls, a scratch MoE, a balancing
  ablation, routing diagnostics, resumable checkpoints and a real Jupyter notebook.
